name: sim.getReferencedHandlesTags
description: Retrieves a list of all referenced handles tags
luaSynopsis: list tags = sim.getReferencedHandlesTags(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: string[] tags = sim.getReferencedHandlesTags(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the scene object that stores the list of handles. Can be optionally combined with sim.handleflag_keeporiginal, in which case the handles that link to originals are retrieved.
outputs:
1. tags: an array with found tags
replacedBy:
- name: refs, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_refs.property
- name: origRefs, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_origRefs.property
